title: Prof
---
<<if isPeriod("Afternoon")>>
    Prof: Hey! You're the last student I'm talking to before leaving, what's up? 
    -> When's the next homework due? 
        <<jump annoyed>> 
    -> Do you have your chapel credits? 
        <<jump annoyed>>
    -> I don't understand the topics from last class. 
        <<jump leaves>>
    -> Uhhhhh I don't have any questions...
        <<jump annoyed>>
<<elseif getBool("scheduledMeeting")>>
    Prof: Alright, go sit down now.
    <<stop>>
<<else>>
    Prof: Oh? Do you have a question?
    -> I need something. <<if hasActions()>>
        <<jump OfficeHours>>
    -> No, sorry.
        <<stop>>
<<endif>>
===

title: OfficeHours
---
Prof: Well if you need something, then come to my office hours later. They'll be in the classroom today after Chapel.
<<setBool "scheduledMeeting" true>>
<<useAction>>
<<stop>>
===

title: annoyed
---
Prof: You seriouslly scheduled a meeting just for that? 
<<gameOver "Don't ask the Prof a dump question.">>
<<stop>>
===

title: leaves
---
Prof: Ah ok, so looking at slidesho...
"LOUD WOLVERINE ROAR"
Prof: OH JEEZ, sorry I gotta GO! 
<<ProfLeaves>>
<<stop>>
===